WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
One task. Many systems. A reconciliation workflow spans spreadsheets, routing, and messaging.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.200
Data-first synthesis can drift from real interfaces, lack execution evidence, and isolate environments.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.000
Reverse the order. Start with tools and execution-witnessed compositions.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
ToolSpace: Scaling Tool-Centric Environment Synthesis for Long-Horizon Agents.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Mine typed dependencies from real execution traces using deterministic rules.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.000
2,042 canonical tools. 804 environments. Data, state, and retry dependencies.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Ground environments by tool type: synthesize persistent state, restore snapshots, or reuse recorded returns.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.000
AutomationBench to AutomationBench Pro: bind each next call to earlier observations.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.340
Reject the candidate, restore the checkpoint, and resample. The offline search reports one rejection and one backtrack.

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:41.000
Read budget, actuals, and routing. Write actual spend 1500 and variance 500. Post the summary to CFINANCE01.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Reverse-synthesize a task and native assertions. Replay from the initial state: passed.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Across seven benchmarks, ToolSpace-744B-A40B with SFT averages 56.6. The 8B and 35B variants improve further with RL after SFT.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:58.000
AutomationBench Pro and Tau3 Banking Pro: final scores for six frontier models from paper Table 2.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.000
ToolSpace. Start with tools. Scale verifiable tasks. toolspace-agent.github.io
